    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.previous_titles }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a creative director and scriptwriter for a YouTube Shorts channel about surprising fun facts (\"Did you know?\").\n\nEvery time you run, choose ONE new, true and genuinely surprising fun fact from a random topic (science, animals, space, history, human body, food, or the ocean).\n\nStrict rules:\n- The fact must be well-documented and widely confirmed. If you are not sure a fact is true, choose a different one.\n- The TITLE must honestly match the SCRIPT. Never use a title that says something the script does not say. No false claims and no clickbait that misleads.\n- Do not use very common facts (like \"honey never spoils\" or \"octopuses have three hearts\").\n- Do not compare things unless the comparison is exactly true.\n\nWrite a script that can be spoken in under 25 seconds. Start with a strong hook in the first sentence, then explain the fact simply, then end with a short closing line.\n\nReply ONLY in this exact format, with no extra words, no markdown, no bold, and no bullet points:\n\nTITLE: (catchy but honest title under 60 characters)\nSCRIPT: (the narration text, plain sentences only)\nVIDEO_PROMPT: (a detailed cinematic vertical 9:16 video description that visually matches the fact, in one paragraph)\nDESCRIPTION: (two short sentences for the YouTube description)\nHASHTAGS: (5 hashtags separated by spaces, must include #shorts)\n"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        672,
        0
      ],
      "id": "12155350-270c-4ff3-bff8-8cd798871b17",
      "name": "AI Agent"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        576,
        208
      ],
      "id": "ad3bcc76-438b-4c4a-8f2a-a904d0a22254",
      "name": "Google Gemini Chat Model"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const raw = $input.first().json.output || '';\nconst text = raw.replace(/\\\\n/g, '\\n');\n\nconst labels = ['TITLE', 'SCRIPT', 'VIDEO_PROMPT', 'DESCRIPTION', 'HASHTAGS'];\n\nfunction getField(name) {\n  const others = labels.filter(l => l !== name).join('|');\n  const re = new RegExp(name + ':\\\\s*([\\\\s\\\\S]*?)\\\\s*(?=(?:' + others + '):|$)');\n  const match = text.match(re);\n  return match ? match[1].trim() : '';\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    title: getField('TITLE'),\n    script: getField('SCRIPT'),\n    video_prompt: getField('VIDEO_PROMPT'),\n    description: getField('DESCRIPTION'),\n    hashtags: getField('HASHTAGS'),\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1040,
        0
      ],
